              {
                "type": "TEXT",
                "id": "9:16028",
                "name": "2–8 players · one shared board  Everybody chooses one covered cell at ",
                "w": 580,
                "h": 350,
                "hSize": "hug",
                "text": "2–8 players · one shared board\n\nEveryone picks one hidden cell at the same time. Your click locks your pick, and nobody sees which cell you chose.\n\nYou have 15 seconds to pick, then 4 seconds to see what everyone picked. A safe pick pays 10 points, plus more the riskier it was. A mine costs points, and costs more the safer the cell looked.\n\nPick the same safe cell as someone else? You split the reward. Run out of time? The safest cell is picked for you, without the 10-point base.\n\nThe board is Small, Medium or Large, chosen when the room is created. The game ends when the board is resolved or fewer than 2 players remain.",
                "textStyle": "Zumpo/Body",
                "fills": [
                  "$Zumpo · UI:color/ink"
                ],
                "autoResize": "height"
              },
